    kind: work_item  # dcc7
    title: "method_call_recovery keys its class hint on dst-is-a-class, so csharp/java construction edges (constructor dst since WI-fagit) contribute no hints"  # dcc7
    status: todo_hard  # dcc7
    priority: 3  # dcc7
